        <tei:p><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n240.jpg" n="110"/><tei:milestone unit="stanza" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:vechayyot_asher_hennah/rachem_metzuqim"/>Have mercy on the pillars (the pious) upon which Thou hast founded the footstool (the earth) and the throne; then the Galgal thunders and the throne resounds from Ophan to Ophan, from Hayah to Hayah, from Cherub to Cherub opposite the throne. <tei:milestone unit="stanza"/></tei:p>
